/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `reviews` DISABLE KEYS */;
INSERT INTO `reviews` VALUES (1,'ARN','User william says: Stockholm is AWESOME! It is my favorite city to visit. I stayed at the Victory hotel in Gamla Stan and the staff was excellent. Be sure to visit the Vasa Museum (Vasamuseet) when you are there. The museum contains a wooden warship, called the Vasa, that sank in Stockholm Harbor during her maiden voyage in 1628'),(2,'GCM','User william says: If you like to scuba dive or snorkel you must go to the Caymans. We have been there five times and am amazed each time. If traveling to Grand Cayman you must visit Stingray City and feed the stingrays. Eating out can get expensive but there are several great restaurants at affordable prices. A great casual place to each is \'Chicken Chicken\'. It is located on 7 mile beach, north of the Marriott in a shopping center across the road from the beach'),(3,'GCM','User ben says: We just got back from Grand Cayman and had a great time. If going to Grand Cayman we recommend you rent a car for at least a couple days and explore the island. There are many great beaches that offer spectacular views and no crowds at all. Our favorite was one called Smith Cove. This is a VERY nice little cove with two small beaches and very good snorkeling. It has a bath house with running water, picnic tables, and nice shade trees. It is about a 5 minute drive south of the cruise ship terminal in a mostly residential area. Just take the road south past the cruise terminal and it will be on your right. It will be easy to miss, so keep looking right for a little cove.'),(4,'LAX','User david says: If you are planning a vacation to the Los Angeles area and want a good beach, take a drive to Zuma Beach. To get there just take the PCH North from Malibu. The beach is nice and will not have a lot of tourists, just mostly locals and surfers. There are also some great little seafood restaurants that serve fresh local seafood.'),(5,'JFK','User charley says: If you are looking for the best pizza is all of New York, go to Joe\'s Pizza at 233 Bleecker in the Village. Joe\'s is just a small place. You order at the counter and there are a few cafe tables where you can stand and enjoy the best pizza you will ever have.'),(6,'NRT','User alice says: My husband and I just returned from a trip to Japan. We had a great time but there was one thing we were not aware of before the trip. Narita Airport is almost 70 km from Tokyo. After a LONG flight we were ready to get to our hotel and sleep. The Narita Express train will take you from the Airport to Tokyo but it takes about an hour. Once we got some sleep we had an awesome time. Tokyo is just one of the coolest places to visit.'),(7,'LHR','User charley says: My favorite site to visit in London is the Tower Bridge. If you go to London you must see the bridge at night. The way it is illuminated at night is just spectacular.  Take the time and walk down by the river Thames and look back at the bridge.'),(8,'LHR','User ben says: Some advice for those who are visiting London for the first time. To get from Heathrow to the city be sure to take the Heathrow Express train. It leaves right from Heathrow airport and takes you non stop to Paddington station. From Paddington it is a short tube or taxi ride to most locations in London.'),(9,'CDG','User charley says: If you have not been to Paris, GO! It is a city that everyone must experience. Be sure to see Paris from the top of the Eiffel Tower. Another great way to see the city is to take one of the boat tours on the river.'),(10,'CDG','User david says: This may be obvious, but if you visit Paris the Louvre is a must see. If you have not been before, you can not be prepared for how large the museum is. This is not a place you rush through in an afternoon. Be sure to allow enough time to enjoy it.'),(11,'YYZ','User william says: We have visited Toronto three times in the past four years and can\'t wait to go back. The entire city is very clean and everyone is always nice and helpful. Every taxi driver we had was always great, knew exactly how to get to our destination and offered suggestions on placed to shop and eat.'),(12,'IAD','User william says: Last summer we took a family vacation to Washington DC. If you are planning a family vacation to Washington there are a few places that you must go with the kids. First, the new Air and Space Museum at Dulles Airport is awesome. Another place we found very interesting was the Bureau of Engraving and Printing. You can take a tour and see real money being printed.'),(13,'TPA','User ben says: Most people talk about Orlando, but Tampa is our favorite place to visit in Florida. If you want to spend some time at an amusement park, Busch Gardens Tampa and Adventure Island are some of the best you will ever visit. Then when you are ready for the beach, head to Clearwater for one of the best beaches on the Gulf of Mexico.'),(14,'HNL','User alice says: My husband and I have just returned from getting married in Hawaii and we loved it. If you are planning a Hawaiian wedding you will not be disappointed. We would also recommend you stay for at least two weeks and visit more than one island. Each island is different and offers unique experiences.');
